                        "review": "LOGistICAL: Italy is more of the same great, addictive game that is LOGistICAL.\n\nHowever, I have to say that the design of the industry chains is excellent, offering interesting exploration and a great chain of challenging industrial unlocks.\n\nThe level of research that has gone into Italy's industries is also higher than some of the other modules so locals will be left smiling.\n\nDisclaimer: I received the product for free as I've been involved in pre-release testing, but that does not impact my recommendation at all, I'm aiming to play this through to completion out of choice!",
